## Configuration

```python
Config(
    mode=Mode.BALANCED,        # lossless | conservative | balanced | aggressive | extreme
    target_ratio=None,         # override the mode's target
    budget_tokens=None,        # hard ceiling (subject to the protection floor)
    min_confidence=0.9,        # adaptive loop: raise budget until confident
    query_weight=1.6,
    marginal_floor=0.04,       # stop when marginal value collapses (ceiling, not quota)
    tokenizer="auto",          # auto | cl100k | o200k | hf:<name> | heuristic
)
Config.preset("rag" | "agent" | "code" | "logs" | "legal" | "safe" | "max")
```

Every knob is documented in `ulrc3/config.py` with the reason for its default.

