## Project layout

```
ulrc3/
  types.py config.py request.py engine.py     core model, orchestration
  tokenization.py                             tiktoken → HF → calibrated heuristic
  detect/                                     oracles + Viterbi region segmentation
  text/                                       segmentation, hashing, term statistics
  ir/       builder · obligations · protection · graph
  passes/   p010 levels → p100 confidence     the compiler pipeline
  pipelines/  prose code conversation logs json tabular
  codeir/   pyast · generic (10 languages)
  convo/    memory DAG          logsir/  template mining
  render/   tokenizer-measured markers
  metrics/  intrinsic · baselines            evaluation
  server/   FastAPI              cache.py recovery.py parallel.py cli.py
bench/      datasets · run_bench · bench_perf · results
tests/      235 tests, guarantees + algorithms + service
```

